metal189.gui.profile=Profile
metal189.gui.profile.desc=Quality presets for shadows, ambient occlusion, light shafts, clouds, parallax, shore foam and ray tracing (ray tracing only on Macs that accelerate it: M3 and later). Changing any of those by hand makes the profile Custom.
metal189.profile.low=Low
metal189.profile.medium=Medium
metal189.profile.high=High
